# Tooling

- Package manager is **Bun**. Lockfile is `web/bun.lock`.
- Install: `cd web && bun install`. Scripts: `bun run dev`, `bun run build` (from `web/`).
- One-off binaries: `bunx vite`, never `npx`.
- Do not create or commit `package-lock.json`, `yarn.lock`, or `pnpm-lock.yaml`.
